    "page.connType.shadow.p.a-darkly-magnetic-yin-yang-pairing": "A darkly magnetic Yin-Yang pairing that shows each other's hidden underbellies — revealing what might otherwise stay hidden, whether you like it or not.",
    "page.connType.shadow.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.shadow.p.this-darkly-magnetic-yin-yang-animal": "This darkly magnetic Yin-Yang animal pairing shows each other's hidden underbellies — revealing what might otherwise stay hidden, whether you like it or not! It's a fantastic pairing for karmic work, helping you both to grow through staying committed to the bond and discovering what to work on together. I've seen it in plenty of romantic couples, even husbands and wives who've been happily married for years, but I've also seen it most easily displayed in student-teacher or parent-child pairings, where the idea of working out your faults and improving yourself is already baked into the type of relationship.",
    "page.connType.shadow.h3.other-connection-types": "Other connection types",
