    "page.connType.rainbow.p.yin-and-yang-companions-each-one.2": "陰 and 陽 companions — Each one brings out the other animal's true colors like a prism, hence the term \"レインボー\" — with this type of connection, you really get to see each other shine! It's a rare pairing, and should be cherished whenever you come across it! It takes a lot of self-work before most people are ready for this type of connection — after all, the full spectrum of your true colors will be on display the entire time, so you'd better be sure you have all your facets polished and shiny!",
